title = "Nausicaä"
description = "Sweep a short blue eye laser. Each glowing patch waits one second at the beam tip, or sticks to a mob in front of the beam, then the trail erupts from its first mark to its last and carves a shallow indent. Standing in an eruption hurts you, not other players, unless you have explosion immunity."
